cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "MAPTER for Ghidra"
abstract: >-
  Ghidra extension that links Ghidra to MAPTER, an interactive 2D map of SAFE
  function embeddings for exploring code reuse across malware binaries.
  Includes the Dash web app and the pipeline that generates maps from your own
  binaries.
